["<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes gateway stop          </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># add -p &lt;profile&gt; for a named profile</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes doctor                </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># add -p &lt;profile&gt; for a named profile</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Refusing `hermes sessions optimize-storage`: another process is using ~/.hermes/state.db.</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  PID 41230 (hermes gateway run): state.db, state.db-shm, state.db-wal</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  PID 41355 (hermes serve --profile work): state.db-wal</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Rewriting the database under a live writer is how every agent ends up refusing turns with the</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">retired state.db-wal error. Nothing is lost.</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Stop them first (`hermes gateway stop`, quit the Desktop app, pause cron), then re-run.</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Override with --force if you accept the risk.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes sessions recover </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--source</span><span class=\"token plain\"> ~/.hermes/state.db --inspect-only</span><br></div></code></pre>"]